From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:31:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): protocol expression, framers and parsers (C1)

- lib.protocol: ProtocolExpression (single implementation, round-trip safe)
- Frame Rule / Parse Rule (JSON v1) + legacy GTEC rule text (read compatible)
- Framers: DELIM, STXETX(+escape), FIXED, LENFIELD; checksum SUM8/XOR8/CRC16_MODBUS
- Parsers: TEXT(CHANNELS/SAMPLES), INFO, BINARY
- tests/juprovider.tests.protocol (xUnit), seed expressions round-trip
- No server, DB, client, terminal or IPC change

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
